IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. OF PROGRAMS.
PROGRAM-ID. BankOfBananaPudding.COBOL.
AUTHOR = "Your Name".
VERSION = 100.0.0.0.0.
SUBCLASS = WORKING-STORAGE, PROGRAM-PROCESSING MODULES OF COBOL FILE.

FUNCTION INITIALIZATION (INITIAL_VALUE).
    DISPLAY 'Welcome to the Bank of Banana Pudding.'
END FUNCTION.

PROCEDURE DIVISION - EXECUTION BLOCK.
ASSIGN 48, 50 (Program ID).
DISCRIMINE SUBSET "EXECUTE" BY: [1], END.
PERFORM 'Execute Function' ONLY WHEN SUBSET IS IDENTIFIED AS "EXECUTE".

MODULE-CLASS = PROGRAM MODULE CLASSIFICATION OF ALGORITHMS THAT WORK WITH DATA OR ARE PART OF AN ALGORITHM DEFINED IN A COBOL FILE, INCLUDING SUBROUTINES (FUNCTIONS) AND MAIN EXECUTION BLOCKS.
SUBJECT TO PRODUCTION USE AND DISTRIBUTION BY THE BANK OF BANANA PUDDING UNDER DIRECTION

PROCEDURE DIVISION - FUNCTIONS FOR PROGRAM PROCESSING MODULE CLASSIFICATION:
    FUNCTION SCHEDULE_TASK (TASK_NAME INITIAL_VALUE START VALUE INSTRUCTION).
        PERFORM PROCESS_TASK OPERATION ON INPUT DATA INTO OUTPUT DATA WHILE TASK NAME CONTAINS THE OPERATIONAL INDICATOR.
            DISPLAY 'Executing: [1]' IF SUBSET IS IDENTIFIED AS "EXECUTE".
                EXIT WHEN ERROR_CODE != 0.
    END FUNCTION.

    FUNCTION EXECUTE_FUNCTIONS (TASK_NAME INITIAL_VALUE START VALUE INSTRUCTION WITHIN CONTEXT).
        PERFORM PROCESS_TASK OPERATION ON INPUT DATA INTO OUTPUT DATA WHILE TASK NAME CONTAINS THE OPERATIONAL INDICATOR FOR THIS FUNCTION.
            DISPLAY 'Executing: [2]' IF SUBSET IS IDENTIFIED AS "EXECUTE".
                EXIT WHEN ERROR_CODE != 0.
    END PROCEDURE.

    FUNCTION MAIN_EXECUTION (TASK_NAME INITIAL_VALUE START VALUE INSTRUCTION WITHIN CONTEXT).
        PERFORM PROCESS_TASK OPERATION ON INPUT DATA INTO OUTPUT DATA WHILE TASK NAME CONTAINS THE OPERATIONAL INDICATOR FOR THIS FUNCTION AND SUBSET IS IDENTIFIED AS "EXECUTE".
            DISPLAY 'Main Execution Block' IF SUBSET IS IDENTIFIED AS "EXECUTE".
    END PROCEDURE.

MODULE-CLASS = MODULE CLASSIFICATION OF ALGORITHMS THAT WORK WITH DATA OR ARE PART OF AN ALGORITHM DEFIN
